===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{dentistry}} the act of [[extracting]] or the condition of being [[extracted]], especially the extraction of a [[tooth]] from its [[socket]]
# an [[extract]] obtained from a [[mixture]] or from a [[plant]] etc
# one's [[origin]], [[lineage]] or [[ancestry]]
# {{context|military}} the act of removing someone from a hostile area to a secure location.

